ARIVE

This distribution contains modified fine-tuning utilities derived from the
Qwen-VL fine-tuning framework published by the Qwen team under the Apache
License 2.0. The upstream projects are:

  https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL
  https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen2.5-VL/tree/main/qwen-vl-finetune

The repository also integrates, but does not redistribute, third-party models
and datasets including Qwen3-VL, GPT-OSS, MIMIC-CXR, CheXbert, and RadGraph.
Those assets retain their own licenses, access requirements, and terms of use.

